Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～呀 快一点啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回来了 我回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哔哔。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叽叽叽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗狂欢节参赛者 募集中。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）啊～ 糟透了～。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.73,0:01:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的考试完全没能一飞冲天啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）考试能一飞冲天这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.62,0:01:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 无论何时 都在一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叽叽叽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和妈妈走散了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.55,0:02:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥博特？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么会在那种地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是坏掉了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些孩子好像在说什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.73,0:02:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呱！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呱——！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是想救妈妈吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个奥博特也能不能也帮帮它呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别、别强人所难啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯——这个嘛，这个就是那个……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这段代码……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马，你看得懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，完全不懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把里面的线接上试试。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这个接上就行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.01,0:03:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个，不能用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.03,0:03:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}试试看吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哔哔 哔 哔。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垃圾 垃圾 垃圾…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，毕竟是在捡垃圾嘛修好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是垃圾！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}瞥了一眼 哔哔。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟过来了啊真是的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事已至此，游马你就照顾照顾它呗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我正忙着决斗呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皮皮。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 难道 要决斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 可是 没有卡组的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皮皮。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:06:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！ 咚哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡「向星星许愿」。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在场上 有攻击力或
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力相同的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其中1只怪兽的等级统一。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将破烂机器人·烧水壶袋鼠的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}统一为与破烂机器人·骑骆驼相同 等级4。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把等级4的茶壶袋鼠和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自行车骆驼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 发条机关！ 发条魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用发条魔术师 对游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害 奥博特！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菜鸟 菜鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 比起你 这台机器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明显 决斗的实力更强。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？ 唔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 好厉害啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 哎？ 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哔哔 哔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.72,0:07:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 好像挺开心的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说这个奥伯特……是女孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？这个奥伯特是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叫奥伯特太可怜了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给它起个可爱的名字吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥博……奥博米娜·闪耀·罗曼诺夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么鬼名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了，叫奥博米就行了，奥博米。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥博米，奥博米！奥博米，奥博米！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……哇～。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来它挺喜欢游马的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，游马，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……吃白饭的有星光体一个就够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥博米，吃白饭的，奥博米，吃白饭的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唉……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晚安　小波米。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皮皮　皮…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}准备完毕。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次也要　好好地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我打扫干净哦　小波特。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:09:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小波米～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的　跑哪去了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊这是打算留张字条吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回来了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）又是宝石强盗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！　这个独家新闻　我绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要把它　搞到手！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　游马你也来帮忙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊　突然之间…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝石强盗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过极秘渠道入手的监控摄像头的影像{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.41,0:09:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于解析到这一步了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 光凭这个还是看不太明白呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《难道… 是奥波米！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}犯人果然是决斗的天才呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.45,0:10:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超高难度的残局决斗式金库{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都能轻轻松松打开。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 如果犯人是奥波米的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那般高超的决斗战术也就说得通了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《难道 奥波米竟然！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}警察从案件发生起平均17分钟就会赶到。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在此之前 犯人必须消失得无影无踪。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从作案现场锁定17分钟移动范围内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后在这些范围全部交汇的地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是犯人的潜伏地点可能性很高。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等　等等　游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:11:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今晚也狠狠赚了一笔啊　嘿嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到竟然用奥博特去宝石抢劫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都没注意到……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……　唔！　谁啊！？　你们这帮家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.41,0:11:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！　竟敢对我们的奥博美
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做出这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥博美？　你在说什么鬼话。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙可是　我忠实的仆从。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！　奥博美是　我们的伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来　把奥博美还回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！　喂　你把那帮家伙收拾掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 奥波米！我们的事你都不记得了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米！？ 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米那家伙 真的把我们的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给忘了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 奥波米！ 决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标确认。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗予以排除。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你有什么对策吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道。 但是 说不定这张卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米！ 通过决斗一定要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我们的事让你想起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR视界 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.83,0:12:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是我！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.85,0:12:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 环保魔法杜绝浪费。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将2只破烂机器人怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破烂机器人·回收机加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 回收机。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 环保魔法反复使用吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将除外的破烂机器人怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最多2只 特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤 破烂机器人·清洁者和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破烂机器人·电脑子。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的破烂机偶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 回收·再犀牛机器人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用再犀牛机器人 攻击嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！ 半不破！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上的1只怪兽不会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小步真的把我们的事给忘了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 绝对要让他想起来！ 小步！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡－！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤新的同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！我我我女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我前辈。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 装备魔法神奇魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给我我我女孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 魔法师族怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 提升５００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错这样一来胜利的方程式就凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动我我我魔术师的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到结束阶段为止 将我我我魔术师的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从４变为８。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 我我我闪电。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 选择２只我我我怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其等级差{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘以３００点的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升到等级8的嘎嘎嘎魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎女孩的等级差是5。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 造成1500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束阶段时 嘎嘎嘎魔术师的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从8变回4。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 为什么？ 嘎嘎嘎女孩有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的超量怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成零的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.39,0:15:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果 把嘎嘎嘎魔术师的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成和嘎嘎嘎女孩一样的3{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤出修正龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击攻击力为零的修正机人的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你本应该能赢的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光赢可不行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小步！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤破烂机·茶壶袋鼠。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:16:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修正机人的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让这张卡以外的怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我消耗3个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让夜壶袋鼠的攻击力提升1500。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 2300！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先用重写机器人攻击我我我少女。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 打开 我我我防御。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我我我怪兽有2只以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我在这回合不会被战斗破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着用夜壶袋鼠攻击我我我魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我防御 也保护我我我魔术师吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你到底在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次 再一次来进行那场决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说… 他是想重现
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候和奥波米的那场决斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧 奥波米。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再让我和你一起开心地决斗吧 奥波米！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧 奥波米！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.39,0:17:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}犀… 犀牛… 机器人的… 效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个结束阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽没有超量素材的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我场上的 攻击力最低的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 双方的玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到被破坏的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 如果这个效果在下一个回合发动的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和奥波米的生命值都会变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会让它结束的在抽到那张卡之前！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿 差不多快到时候了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个装置要启动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炸弹程序启动。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炸弹程序启动。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有1分钟程序就无法解除了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这到底是怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米要爆炸了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要避免这个只能在1分钟以内 让奥波米自己{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解除程序。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1分钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你下一次抽卡将决定一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的抽卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～！ 一飞冲天吧 我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向星星许愿，发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皮皮！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我场上存在攻击力或守备力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.07,0:19:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同的怪兽2只以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其中1只怪兽的等级统一。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.05,0:19:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将我场上的我我我少女的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}统一为和我我我魔术师相同的等级4！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好烂……好烂……可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了，小鸟，回来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马是通过重现和小鸟的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想让我们回忆起来……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太烂了，太烂了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～ 奥波米！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米还是没法获得自由吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:20:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此那就再来一发！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级４的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我女孩进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.66,0:20:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.55,0:20:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.３９ 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.15,0:20:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动我我我女孩的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我我我女孩 与我我我魔术师一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为叠放单位时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的１只怪兽超量怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 重写机器人的攻击力变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米，现在我来救你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.53,0:20:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你个菜鸟，菜鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！那个破铜烂铁机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.69,0:21:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}备用的炸弹，我带来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你们是白痴吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}昨夜凌晨，连续宝石抢劫案的犯人被逮捕了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不甘心！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来应该是我拿到独家新闻的～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我出门啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 决斗饭 决斗饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哟这样一来今天的决斗也万无一失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 菜鸟 菜鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊… 喂～！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.49,0:22:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住口 我才不是 菜鸟！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用相同等级的怪兽两只以上来召唤的方法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叫做什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是 超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.25,0:24:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.94,0:24:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场上集齐相同等级的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.78,0:24:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是很重要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家也来超量召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.67,0:24:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤强力的怪兽吧！

